SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

Port of ui/data/ui/conversation_view.blp (conversation_chat); macOS:
MessageView/ConversationChatViewController.swift (loadView). The chat
layout of the conversation (docs/plans/chat-view.md), under the host's
strip (ConversationView): the timeline's column (900 wide at most, 16 at
the sides, 4 above, 16 below) without its gutter and line; the issue card
of a Jira conversation on top across the column (12 below the top), the
rows after it, oldest first, added in code (ConversationChatView.xaml.cs):
the bubbles with their avatars (ConversationChatRow), the issue's events
and the row of older messages centred (ConversationChatCenterRow). The
view's anchor starts at its bottom (VerticalAnchorRatio 1: a chat at its
end stays at its end as rows and bodies come); the code moves it to the top
(0) once the user scrolls away from the end and back when the end shows.
-->
<UserControl
    x:Class="Malachi.App.Reader.Conversation.ConversationChatView"
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
    xmlns:reader="using:Malachi.App.Reader"
    AutomationProperties.AutomationId="ConversationChat"
    IsTabStop="False">
    <UserControl.Resources>
        <ResourceDictionary>
            <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
                <ResourceDictionary Source="ms-appx:///Reader/Conversation/ConversationStyles.xaml" />
            </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
        </ResourceDictionary>
    </UserControl.Resources>
    <ScrollViewer
        x:Name="Scroller"
        AutomationProperties.AutomationId="ConversationChatScroller"
        HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled"
        HorizontalScrollMode="Disabled"
        IsTabStop="False"
        VerticalAnchorRatio="1"
        VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
        <Grid x:Name="Document">
            <StackPanel
                x:Name="Column"
                MaxWidth="900"
                Padding="16,4,16,16">
                <!-- The issue card, across the column. -->
                <reader:IssueCardView
                    x:Name="IssueCard"
                    Margin="0,12,0,0"
                    AutomationProperties.AutomationId="ConversationChatIssueCard" />
            </StackPanel>
        </Grid>
    </ScrollViewer>
</UserControl>
